- content_for :title, "Saved searches"

%div{class: "mb-6"}
  %h1{class: page_title_class} Saved searches
  %p{class: "mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600"}
    Every list's search panel has a place to save a search under a name. Each one is kept for its list, apart from its layout.

- if @saved_searches.empty?
  %p{class: "text-sm text-slate-500"} None saved yet.
- else
  %ul{class: "grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"}
    - @saved_searches.each do |key, searches|
      - list = @saved_search_lists[key]
      - next unless list
      %li{class: "rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm"}
        %h2{class: "font-semibold"}= link_to list.label, url_for(list.route.to_sym), class: "hover:underline"
        %ul{class: "mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm"}
          - searches.each do |search|
            %li{class: "inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-slate-300 bg-white text-slate-700"}
              = link_to search.name, "#{url_for(list.route.to_sym)}?#{search.params.to_query}", class: "py-0.5 pl-3 pr-1 font-medium hover:text-slate-900"
              = button_to saved_search_path(search), method: :delete, form_class: "inline-flex",
                aria: {label: "Remove the saved search #{search}"},
                class: "mr-1 rounded-full p-0.5 text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-900" do
                = icon("x", size: 12)
